{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9831","id":4763425435,"node_id":"PR_kwDOLj5faM8AAAABG-wamw","html_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9831","diff_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9831.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/marin-community/marin/pull/9831.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/9831","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9831/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/9831/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/issues/9831/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/statuses/fb85462562ab2e59b58f87e6157d9adf71df89ea","number":9831,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[grug] Correct hero remat and collective scheduling; build PGLE profiles","user":{"login":"mcwitt","id":319411,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxOTQxMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/319411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt","html_url":"https://github.com/mcwitt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcwitt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Carry-offloaded hero runs stop recomputing ~10 GiB of backward values per step that already fit in HBM, which shortens the step by 1.18% (13.899 to 13.737 s on one 64-GPU hero rack, restore step-180000, seed 0, 100 steps). Ragged runs without the carry offload run their collectives one at a time, and `pgle_profile` builds an XLA PGLE profile from one trace of the train step. No model code changes.\n\nWith the layer carry offloaded to pinned host memory, XLA's `HloRematerialization` charged the 36 GiB carry stack against the device memory limit and recomputed values that fit (143 remat clones, 0.63 s/step of compute). The launcher now defaults `--xla_gpu_enable_host_memory_offloading=true` whenever the carry is offloaded, so remat counts host buffers as host memory. Only the remat pass reads the flag, after scheduling and copy insertion, so it cannot reorder the carry reload against its consumer. XLA has no narrower flag: this one also lets remat offload values to host when device memory runs short, which a step that fits in HBM does not trigger.\n\nA ragged run without the carry offload keeps the latency-hiding scheduler off, and the collective overlap limit binds only that scheduler, so XLA's default scheduler can start two ragged transports at once. Compiled for a mocked EP64 topology, the program does so in the forward and in the backward, and on GB200 several collectives in flight have hung the ragged transport or given run-to-run different gradients. The launcher now forces `--xla_gpu_disable_async_collectives=ALLCOLLECTIVES` for that configuration.\n\nXLA's default latency estimator gives every collective the same small latency, so with one collective in flight it treats a multi-millisecond ragged transport as hidden under one GEMM. A profile built by `pgle_profile` from the program's own trace shortened the hero step with all of #9708 from 12.611 to 12.515 s (+0.77%). A profile applies only to the program it was traced from, so nothing uses one by default; the README describes the trace, build and rerun loop.\n\nSplit from #9708. Part of #9636.\n","labels":[{"id":10166074947,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLj5faM8AAAACXfH-Qw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/labels/agent-generated","name":"agent-generated","description":"Created by automation/agent","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11981276996,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLj5faM8AAAACyiPHRA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marin-community/marin/labels/agentic-lint","name":"agentic-lint","description":"Local agentic lint review completed","color":"1D76DB","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-06T19:07:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-06T20:08:18Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7087fb4636e00ba6b31bf7025316a3b8662cb33e","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"dlwh","id":9633,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk2MzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9633?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh","html_url":"https://github.com/dlwh","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlwh/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"marin-community:mcwitt/hero-launcher-xla","ref":"mcwitt/hero-launcher-xla","repo":{"id":775839592,"node_id":"R_kgDOLj5faA","name":"marin","full_name":"marin-community/marin","owner":{"login":"marin-community","id":210491